      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRISTINE (1) has a strong record here with two wins and a minor from six starts. Scored by half a length last time (22.27) in a Grade 5 over 390m at Shepparton. Appeals as a leading chance in this. SKY FALCON (4) shapes well for this on his enormous win a few runs back, getting around Shepparton over 390m in 21.91 then hitting the frame in both runs since. Top win three back and rates a key player again. SPOT THE ANGEL (6) started big odds but ran a huge race last time when finishing 2nd over 390m at this track (22.07)in Grade 5. Was a winner Bendigo in lesser company the start prior. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to be in the finish again. DOONGALLA AL (8) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish.",
